        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 7m x 1.9x\r\nTiled flooring, radiator cover, blinds, storage under the stairs.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining: 4.61m x 4.66m\r\nTiled flooring, fitted kitchen, integrated dishwasher, double oven, hob, extractor fan, breakfast bar, light fitting, blinds, French doors.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 4.68m x 4.87m\r\nSolid Oak timber floor, solid fuel stove with cast-iron fireplace with granite hearth, venetian blinds, c/p.\r\n\r\nUtility: 2.77m x 1.59m\r\nMaple fitted units, sink, gas boiler, side access teak door. \r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom: 2.73m x 5.17\r\nSolid Oak timber flooring, c/p.\r\n\r\nDownstairs W.C: 1.38m x 1.52\r\nTiled flooring, w.c., w.h.b., light fitting\r\n\r\nLanding: 2.1m x 2.5\r\nCarpet\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom: 4.06m x 4.28m\r\nCarpet, c/p/b\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 1.08m x 2.56m\r\nTiled throughout, w.c., w.h.b., electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two: 3.36m x 4.07m\r\nCarpet, blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom Three: 3.21m  x 2.80m\r\nCarpet, blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom Four: 2.50m x 3.24m \r\nCarpet, blinds\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 2.10m x 2.07m\r\nTiled throughout, w.c., w.h.b., bath, light fitting\r\n\r\nGarden: 130m2."
