      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superbly presented five-bedroom detached residence extends to approximately 155 sq. m. and offers an exceptional amount of living and bedroom accommodation over two floors.\r\nShowroom Condition Throughout – Beautifully maintained and superbly presented, offering a genuine walk-in opportunity for the new owners.\r\nExcellent Five-Bedroom Layout – Four generous double bedrooms on the first floor, together with a versatile fifth bedroom at ground-floor level, ideal for guests, home working or family use.\r\nBright & Spacious Kitchen/Dining Room – A wonderful everyday family space with a breakfast bar and French doors opening directly onto the rear garden, allowing excellent natural light throughout.\r\nFully Fitted Kitchen with Integrated Appliances – Excellent storage and worktop space complemented by an integrated dishwasher, double oven, hob and extractor fan.\r\nSeparate Utility with Maple Fitted Units – A highly practical utility room featuring fitted maple units, providing valuable additional storage and workspace.\r\nBeautifully Presented Sitting Room – Featuring a solid-fuel stove, cast-iron fireplace, granite hearth and solid oak timber flooring, creating a warm and inviting reception room.\r\nLarge Private Rear Garden – Approx. 130 m² – A generous, enclosed lawned garden with gated access to both sides, ideal for children, pets, outdoor dining and entertaining.\r\nSuperb Parking & Convenient Location – Extensive cobblelock private driveway offering excellent off-street parking, with Ballyragget providing convenient access to Kilkenny City, Castlecomer, Durrow and Carlow."
